{"id":1010202,"chapter_id":1010202,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"路人A","content":"怎么又是这妮子？她身后不是上次那些来抓她的人吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"路人B","content":"不会又要来闹事了吧？我可没有几个花盆够她砸了……","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"你和嗷呜刚回到刚才闹事的地界，就遭了不少冷眼。但嗷呜对这些议论声并不敏感，她现在一心只想找到她的狮头。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"大概有那么大，那么长，那么宽——","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"她正对着一位路过的老妇手舞足蹈地比划着。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"老妇","content":"抱歉啊小姑娘，我有老花眼，恐怕没见过你说的这个世界上什么最华丽最漂亮的狮头啊。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"嗷呜并不气馁，敲响下一户人家的大门。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我之前就是带着它，路过了对面的肉干铺！我就进去看了一眼，出来狮头就不见了。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"居民","content":"没见过没见过！每天路过肉干铺流口水的小孩可多了去了，我哪能都记得？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"又吃了一记闭门羹，嗷呜不服气地对着门做了个鬼脸。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我没有流口水！你才流口水呢！略！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"肉干铺也问过了？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗷呜又不傻，第一个问的就是肉干铺啊。问了好——几遍，都说没印象！还把嗷呜赶出来了。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"不应该啊，那么大那么显眼的狮头，就算偷走，一时间也不方便藏匿，肯定有什么人看到才对……","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"？？","content":"是啊，那么大那么显眼的狮头，肯定有人看到了。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗯？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"嗷呜歪着头，用手竖起自己两侧的丸子发揪，循着声音靠近。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"什么东西在说话？鬼鬼祟祟的！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"？？","content":"呵呵，只是个在这里捡垃圾的老东西罢了……","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"一名衣衫褴褛的佝偻老人从暗箱里慢慢踱步出来，带着些谄媚的笑意。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"拾荒老头","content":"你们要找的是不是一个这么宽，这么大，世界上最华丽最漂亮的狮头啊？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"那老头只是重复了一遍嗷呜刚刚描述给别人的话，嗷呜就立刻上当了。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你见过吗？在哪里在哪里！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"拾荒老头","content":"想都不用想，肯定是那个小鬼头偷的。那孩子在这儿没爹没娘的，每天偷鸡摸狗，靠些街坊领居的救济活着。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"拾荒老头","content":"我猜肯定是那小子没见识，看到狮头以为是什么稀罕宝贝，就给顺走啦。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"狮头明明就是个超级稀罕的宝贝！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"嗷呜不服气地争辩，却依然没有发现老人话里的蹊跷。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"这些都是你的推测吧？你真的亲眼见到他拿走舞狮头了吗？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"拾荒老头","content":"啊哈哈，你们自己去看看不就知道了？这可是唯一的线索，总好过在这里像个无头苍蝇似的讨人嫌吧？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我是无头狮王，不是无头苍蝇！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"拾荒老头","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"听你的意思，你知道这个“小偷”现在在哪儿？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"拾荒老头","content":"当然——","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"老头笑着，伸出手，掌心向上，对着你摊了两下。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"这是什么？地址的暗号吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"嗷呜皱着眉头模仿老头的动作，企图悟出其中玄机。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"……多少？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"拾荒老头","content":"不多，五百。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"options":["讨价还价","给他五百"],"style":6,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202039,"trial_step":39,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"讨价还价","goto":40},{"text":"给他五百","goto":42}]},{"step":40,"speaker":"拾荒老头","content":"啧啧啧，你也不希望这位小姑娘不开心吧？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"和这样的人继续纠缠没有意义，你最终还是拿出了五百狄斯币。老头一手收钱，一手已经为你们指出了方向。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202041,"trial_step":41,"next":[43]},{"step":42,"content":"你从口袋里数出狄斯币放在老头手上，老头也很爽快，一手收钱，一手已经为你们指出了方向。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202042,"trial_step":42,"next":[43]},{"step":43,"speaker":"拾荒老头","content":"走到底，有个暗巷，那小子偷了东西都喜欢藏在这个见不得光的地方。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"老头数着钱又颤巍巍退回了街道深处，嗷呜却还在思考老头的手势。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"这个动作到底是什么意思啊？你刚刚给了他什么？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"没什么，这种小事交给场记处理就好。我们还是先去他说的地方看看吧。","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"对，小偷！去抓小偷！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"嗷呜被轻易转移了注意力，雄赳赳气昂昂地走在前头，你却并没有完全信任这条五百元的线索。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"不过那老头虽然可疑，有一句话却说得没错，这个男孩是你们目前打听到的唯一头绪。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我看到了！嗷呜的狮头！！！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"才走到巷口嗷呜就兴奋地叫出声，一路小跑着往深处前进。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"你快步跟上，却在距离目的地不远处被突然停下的嗷呜挡住了去路。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"content":"怎么停下了？你说的狮头呢？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嘘——！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"嗷呜用力拽了拽你的袖子不让你出声。你顺着她的视线看去，在废品堆成的小山后，嗷呜的狮头正在上下有节奏地跃动着。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"狮头之下，是一个脏兮兮的、矮小的、瘦削到几乎要被狮头压垮的脆弱身板。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"狮头下的身体，正非常吃力地操纵着狮头蹲下、跳起，使劲时还会发出稚嫩的闷哼。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"他……他在学我？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"明明是嗷呜眼中最基本的蹲起动作，明明完成得非常差劲，但嗷呜的视线就是忍不住跟着狮头一上一下。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"那老头居然没有骗人，还真的在这里……","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"换做平时，嗷呜肯定大喊着“对哦！老头说他是小偷！”就冲上去了，但此时嗷呜仿佛没有听到你的声音。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"她全神贯注地看着眼前笨拙的演出，眼里满溢着兴奋和好奇。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"你没有打断，和她一起透过废品的缝隙窥探这个男孩的演出。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"一，二，三，四……","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"嗷呜轻声数着拍子，似乎比舞狮的人更加紧张。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"你原本以为嗷呜所说的“学她”只是模仿大致的样式，但看了一会你才发现男孩的招式似乎遵照什么规律在变化着，招式的编排你似乎在哪里见过……","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"这是……？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"这是嗷呜在电影里表演的那一段！他看过嗷呜的电影诶！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"嗷呜努力压低了音量，但还是难以掩饰此时的惊喜。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"马上就到最最最最重要的最后亮相了！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"攥着你袖子的小手越握越紧。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"在你们期待的注视下，男孩一边艰难回忆着步子，犹豫着左右跳了两下，最后对着天空，将狮头举过了头顶。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"亮相完成。你们也终于看清了男孩的模样。灰扑扑的小脸上，一双眼睛闪着期待的光望着手中的狮头。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"他屏住呼吸，一直保持着这个姿势，五秒，十秒，半分钟……","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"他在等什么？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"这段舞狮不是你编排的吗，你也不知道吗？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"可是跳到这里就已经结束啦。电影之后就是嗷呜获得狮头之力变成超级英雄的光辉时刻了！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"喂，你不会没有看过嗷呜的舞狮大电影吧！你怎么会不知道后面发生了什么？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"咳，当然看过……","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"男孩","content":"骗子！！！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"content":"男孩突然愤怒大喊，打断了你们的闲聊。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"男孩","content":"明明什么都不会发生！都是骗人的！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"你们还没来得及对男孩突如其来的怒气做出反应，就见男孩高举起狮头，正要将狮头砸向地面——","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"啊啊啊住手哇！你这个混蛋臭小偷！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"嗷呜近乎本能地尖叫着扑出去，好在有狂厄对身体机能的加持，再加上常年舞狮训练积攒的身手，还是在千钧一发之际接住了狮头。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你知不知道自己在干什么啊！这可是狄斯城唯一仅有的超级无敌霹雳精美华丽舞狮头啊！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"嗷呜摔得满身灰尘也顾不上，骂骂咧咧地抱住狮头检查起来。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"还好没摔出什么事来，不然我一定要抓你去金猊乡当苦力学徒，没日没夜做十个狮头赔给我！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"男孩","content":"你、你是……","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"男孩似乎被突然闯出来的嗷呜吓到了。看了看嗷呜，又看了看从废品堆后走出来的你，又看了看嗷呜。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"男孩","content":"你是电影里那个……","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"哼哼，算你有眼光！我就是电影里那个天下第一天才的舞狮大——","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"男孩","content":"大骗子！你是电影里那个大骗子！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"诶！！！！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"嗷呜一句“舞狮大王”被噎回了肚子里，气得差点在原地跳起来。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你你你你！你这个小偷！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"男孩","content":"骗子！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"臭小偷！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"男孩","content":"大骗子！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"男孩看着瘦弱，声量却不小。嗷呜也是第一次碰见比自己更吵更蛮不讲理的对手，又着急又委屈，跺着脚躲到了你的身后。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"被夹在两个小孩子中间对着吼，你感觉自己的头发都被吼炸了。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗷呜不是骗子！呜哇——！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"男孩","content":"你就是！说什么舞狮就能获得回家的力量！都是骗人的！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我没骗人！我真的找到了！呜呜呜呜——小场记你帮我作证！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"男孩","content":"那为什么我没找到！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"男孩","content":"我学你的样子，用你的狮头！我做了一模一样的事情！但是什么都没有发生！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"男孩","content":"没有什么狗屁力量！没有家乡！没有朋友！没有爸爸妈妈！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"content":"男孩对着你们，用尽所有力气大吼着。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"男孩","content":"骗子！你和你的狮头，都是骗人的！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"content":"嗷呜好像被吓到了，眼泪还来不及止住，红着眼睛紧紧抱住狮头，愣愣看着男孩。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你、你……","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"content":"她无法控制抽噎，但还是一顿一顿地提问。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你、想……回、家？","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"男孩看着眼前被吓懵的嗷呜，有些丧气地别过脑袋，咬了咬嘴唇。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"speaker":"男孩","content":"……对，但我不知道……也找不到。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"小男孩说完，似乎也没了再和嗷呜对吼的心情，一屁股坐在了废品堆旁边，沮丧地低着头。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我、我不是骗子！我真的有狮头的力量，我很厉害的。","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"content":"虽然还带着哭腔，但明显已经恢复了不少往日的威风。嗷呜从你身后探出头，抱着狮头试探着向男孩靠近一步。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我是、天下第一超级无敌霹雳厉害的、舞狮大王嗷呜！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"content":"她腾出一只手拍了拍胸脯，小男孩皱着眉头，看着嗷呜，似乎在猜测她到底想做什么。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我带你去找你的家乡！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我能找到自己的家乡，一定也能帮你找到！对吧！小场记！","voice":["vo_trial_10202_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"content":"啊？嗯！","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110202123,"trial_step":123}]}